        "body": "<p class=\"p-large\"><span style=\"color: #888888; font-size: 12px\">KPI additions in progress: Margin $/%, Media Spend, CAC/CPO, Traffic, CVR, Net $ — those rows are present but blank on purpose.</span></p>"
